00:07:36.439 --> 00:07:39.169
There’s also a little string he’s pulling
on when he’s trapped inside the coffin,

00:07:39.169 --> 00:07:42.310
which I’m guessing is tied to this bell
on his tombstone.

00:07:42.310 --> 00:07:46.689
Let it be known that when I die, I would like
to have this feature in my coffin in case

00:07:46.689 --> 00:07:48.469
I come back as a zombie.

00:07:48.469 --> 00:07:52.599
Actually, just build a big fire on home plate
at Wrigley Field and toss my coffin in.

00:07:52.599 --> 00:07:53.599
Roll the next spot.

00:07:53.600 --> 00:07:55.160
“Here to investigate the death of a Nun.

00:07:56.560 --> 00:07:57.560
On September 7th.

00:07:57.920 --> 00:07:59.880
