00:08:21.600 --> 00:08:24.480
It may lead to the corridor first scene at
the end of Annabelle creation.

00:08:24.480 --> 00:08:28.240
One of the legends about The White Monks tell
about a tunnel that was dug from the Abbey to

00:08:28.259 --> 00:08:32.120
a nearby river, that could have been used
to escape in the event of an invasion.

00:08:32.120 --> 00:08:34.900
Perhaps this corridor is supposed to be that
very tunnel.

